From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:36:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] plot_gateways.jl: Tsubouchi et al. (2018) monthly volume
 transports, GLORYS Arctic budget panel

With a run file whose dates fall in Sep 2005 - Aug 2006, draws Tsubouchi et al.'s
monthly values (read from their Fig. 5a, nested/references/) over their 30-day
blocks and prints observed / GLORYS / model means per block. Draws the GLORYS
Arctic volume budget (glorys_arctic_budget.csv). Works without gateways.csv.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvmJrXadb5LQWtyUVrz
