+# Tsubouchi et al. (2018, JPO 48, 2029-2055), Fig. 5a: monthly ocean volume transport (Sv), positive into the Arctic.
+# Read by eye from the figure (about +-0.2 Sv); not published as a table. "Months" are 30-day blocks (6 x 5-day steps)
+# from about 5 September 2005; the tenth ("Jul06") is 35 days. Net is constrained to about -0.15 Sv by the inverse model.
+# Annual means (Table 3): Davis -2.1+-0.7, Fram -1.1+-1.2, BSO 2.3+-1.2, Bering 0.7+-0.7 (+-1 std of the monthly values).
+month,davis,fram,bso,bering
+2005-09,-1.6,-3.5,4.0,1.1
+2005-10,-1.7,-1.0,2.0,0.6
+2005-11,-2.1,-0.9,3.2,-0.5
+2005-12,-1.6,-0.4,2.1,-0.4
+2006-01,-2.1,-2.5,4.3,0.1
+2006-02,-2.4,-0.8,1.8,1.1
+2006-03,-1.0,-1.9,1.6,1.2
+2006-04,-1.3,-0.7,1.5,0.4
+2006-05,-2.3,1.0,-0.3,1.3
+2006-06,-3.1,-0.7,2.7,1.0
+2006-07,-2.7,-1.3,2.5,1.3
+2006-08,-3.0,-0.6,2.1,1.4
